# SABOTAGE: samenerp-homepage-production-origin-cta MED
# The homepage's own docs CTA points at /docs so the page works on whatever host
# serves it (preview, self-host, a self-hoster's domain, the test endpoint). This
# patch restores the production-only absolute CTA: the page still matches its
# artifact byte for byte and every route still answers, but a visitor on any other
# host is handed off to samenerp.kubeworkz.io. Only the link leg can see it.
# APP: samenerp
# TEST_FILES: test/homepage_route_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: GET / links this host's docs and account routes, never an absolute site origin
diff --git a/samenerp/priv/homepage.html b/samenerp/priv/homepage.html
