-      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/docs">Docs</a>
+      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://samenerp.kubeworkz.io/docs">Docs</a>
       <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/kubeworkz/samen-erp">GitHub</a>
